+## Desktop Mini Player
+
+Use **View → Open Mini Player**, **Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+M**, or **Mini Player** in expanded
+Now playing. Only one Tagcast window is visible; returning to the main interface
+closes the compact window. The same audio element and queue keep playing. Pin,
+seeking and transport remain available. See [Mini Player](Playback-and-queue#desktop-mini-player).
