+## More reliable interrupted saves
+
+Candidate mutations are sent once. An interrupted reply never triggers a blind
+repeat of metadata, cleanup, ratings or artwork assignments. Tagcast stops later
+writes and uses read-back where supported, retaining uncertain and partial results.
+A new reviewed action still needs fresh conflict checks. Safe reads and explicit
+OAuth refresh retain their existing recovery paths. See [save recovery](Saving-and-history#automatic-retries).
 
