 ## Devices & queue synchronisation
 
 **Enable queue synchronisation and remote control** is off by default. Save first, then use **Reconnect iBroadcast** to approve queue permissions. **Devices** controls connection or remote-device choice; enabling the setting alone does not start local playback. Read the [experimental remote-control guide](Queue-synchronisation) before using it.
