+### iBroadcast account and service limits
+
+iBroadcast determines storage, bandwidth, track visibility and streaming
+entitlements. Its [announced subscription changes](https://news.ibroadcast.com/an-important-update-on-ibroadcast-s-pricing)
+introduce different account limits; plan names alone do not establish a capability.
+Tagcast uses the account capabilities returned by iBroadcast and cannot remove
+provider limits or reveal unavailable tracks. Missing music is not automatically
+evidence that Tagcast removed it. Check iBroadcast's account and Track Dashboard
+when availability differs. Tagcast itself remains free and open source.
